      en: ["Officially inaugurated on January 6, 1979, by the Méndez family.", "Situated on a vast 40-hectare site in San Clemente del Tuyú.", "Houses the only orca in South America living under human care.", "The Mundo Marino Foundation has rescued over 10,000 animals since its inception.", "Includes a specialized veterinary hospital for marine animal pathology.", "The Safari Terrestre attraction allows wildlife observation over 25 hectares.", "The oceanarium features an open-air theater with thousands of seats.", "Remains one of the most visited tourist attractions on the Argentine Atlantic coast."],
